<section class="lr-card"><span class="lr-eyebrow">YOUR SERVER RESORT</span><h1><%= @resource.name %></h1><p><%= @resource.description %></p><div class="lr-price"><%= number_to_currency(@intent.price_cents / 100.0) %><small>Per <%= @resource.billing_interval == 'annual' ? 'year' : 'month' %> · tax calculated at secure checkout</small></div><ul class="lr-amenities"><% @resource.accommodations.each do |item| %><li>✓ <%= item %></li><% end %></ul><p>Reserved start: <%= @intent.starts_at.in_time_zone(@resource.timezone).strftime('%B %-d, %Y · %-I:%M %p %Z') %></p><p>This reservation will belong to your signed-in Lightek account. Payment, server access, and future package changes stay together in My reservations.</p><%= button_to 'Reserve & continue to payment ↗', book_network_reservation_path(token: @intent.token), class: 'lr-button' %></section>
